        {
          "text": "UJehova wayesethi kuMose: “Vuka ekuseni kakhulu, ume phambi kukaFaro; bheka, Uphumela emanzini; wathi kuye: “Usho kanje uJehova, uthi: Bavumele abantu bami ukuba bahambe, ukuze bangikhonze.",
